"- Ensure LM Studio server is **running.** (Default port is 1234)\n"
"- Enable **CORS** in LM Studio config."

#: src/settings/ai/llm/provider-context.ts
msgid ""
"- Ensure Ollama is **running** (`ollama serve`)\n"
"- Pull a model first (`ollama pull llama3.2`)"
msgstr ""
"- Ensure Ollama is **running** (`ollama serve`)\n"
"- Pull a model first (`ollama pull llama3.2`)"

#: src/settings/ai/llm/provider-context.ts
msgid ""
"- Ensure the Unsloth server is **running.** (Default port is 8888)\n"
"- Paste the API key from Unsloth. It starts with `sk-unsloth-`.\n"
"- Only models **loaded** in Unsloth show up in the list."
msgstr ""
"- Ensure the Unsloth server is **running.** (Default port is 8888)\n"
"- Paste the API key from Unsloth. It starts with `sk-unsloth-`.\n"
"- Only models **loaded** in Unsloth show up in the list."

#: src/settings/ai/llm/provider-context.ts
msgid ""
"- Uses Apple's on-device **System Language Model**.\n"
"- Requires macOS 26 or later, a Mac that supports Apple Intelligence, and Apple Intelligence turned on.\n"
"- This experiment is text-only and works best with shorter transcripts."
msgstr ""
"- Uses Apple's on-device **System Language Model**.\n"
"- Requires macOS 26 or later, a Mac that supports Apple Intelligence, and Apple Intelligence turned on.\n"
